<title>USA: IPO PRICING-Styling 2.9 mln at $10/shr.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING-Styling 2.9 mln at $10/shr.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	   Styling Technology Inc</p>
<p>   Priced At					 $10</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range	     $10 - $12</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			2,900,000</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter Friedman, Billings, Ramsey</p>
<p>NOTE: The Phoenix-based perfumes/cosmetics company raised the number of shares to 2.9 million from 2.8 million on Wednesday.  The company originally filed to offer 2.2 million shares.</p>
</text>
